1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,460
Humanity's journey into space has begun to unlock unprecedented scientific and technological potential.

2
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:13,550
Advanced telescopes now capture cosmic phenomena invisible to the naked eye.

3
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:20,340
New materials developed in microgravity environments are revolutionizing industries on Earth.

4
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:26,720
Space missions are creating global collaboration opportunities for scientific discovery.

5
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:32,790
The Artemis program aims to establish a sustainable lunar presence by 2030.

6
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:38,640
Space exploration is a catalyst for innovation that benefits all of humanity.
